     "<div><div style=\"display:inline;width:576px\"><div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Hi all,<p>It&#39;s time to figure out if and when we&#39;ll have D-RUG meetings over the summer.  Please fill out this form to pick your preferred time.<p>Note that we will be organizing topic/tutorial speakers over the summer, only Q&amp;A/co-work time.  However, anyone who wants to present work for feedback (like this Monday&#39;s talk) is welcome to sign up to do so.<p>- Noam</p></p></p></p>\r\nIf you have trouble viewing or submitting this form, you can fill it out online:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Glwrda3mw9xqOMMd5Dc8kqeP4qr6FuVYgxiITmUJAhU/viewform?c=0&amp;w=1&amp;usp=mail_form_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Glwrda3mw9xqOMMd5Dc8kqeP4qr6FuVYgxiITmUJAhU/viewform?c%3D0%26w%3D1%26usp%3Dmail_form_link&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468923500000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NUqMmFyBsQ0KzfKa_OhHR\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Glwrda3mw9xqOMMd5Dc8kqeP4qr6FuVYgxiITmUJAhU/viewform?c=0&amp;w=1&amp;usp=mail_form_link</a>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:.67em 0\">D-RUG Summer Sessions</h1></div>\r\n<div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;display:inline\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div><div><form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Glwrda3mw9xqOMMd5Dc8kqeP4qr6FuVYgxiITmUJAhU/formResponse\" method=\"POST\" target=\"_blank\"><ol role=\"list\">\r\n<div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\">\r\n<label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">How likely/often do you think you will attend D-RUG summer work sessions?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"How likely/often do you think you will attend D-RUG summer work sessions?  \" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.5em 0 0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.315460170\" value=\"(A) Very likely / often\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"(A) Very likely / often\"></span>\r\n<span>(A) Very likely / often</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.315460170\" value=\"(B) Maybe / occasionally\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"(B) Maybe / occasionally\"></span>\r\n<span>(B) Maybe / occasionally</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.315460170\" value=\"(C) Very unlikely / never\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"(C) Very unlikely / never\"></span>\r\n<span>(C) Very unlikely / never</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div role=\"listitem\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:0;margin-top:0;max-width:100%\">\r\n<label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold;margin-top:.83em;margin-bottom:.83em\">If you answered (A) or (B), what times would you prefer?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Check all times you could attend.  We&#39;ll pick the most popular time.</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"group\" aria-label=\"If you answered (A) or (B), what times would you prefer? Check all times you could attend.  We&#39;ll pick the most popular time. \" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.5em 0 0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.739689572\" value=\"Tues 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Tues 10-12</span>\r\n</lab